# Shell bottom toolbar (frozen)

Unless the user **explicitly** asks to change the shared toolbar component, do **not** modify Esc/exit logic in:

- `package/core/lib/ui/shell/SystemToolbar.ps1`
- `package/core/lib/ui/shell/Exit.ps1` (exit confirm flow)

## Required behavior

- **Esc once** → show bottom exit confirmation bar (`Request-ShellExit` / `exitConfirm`)
- **On confirm bar** → Y or Esc confirms quit; N cancels
- Do **not** map Esc to “back”, “dismiss page”, or Enter-equivalent without user approval

## Allowed in feature pages (e.g. `DepOperationView.ps1`)

- Pass existing flags such as `-AllowEnter` so **Enter** returns after an operation completes
- Fix input buffering in the **feature** layer (do not swallow Enter/Esc during winget poll)
- Do **not** add toolbar shortcuts that bypass exit confirm

If toolbar behavior must change, confirm with the user first.
